    "date": "27 April 2025",
    "category": "testimonies",
    "author": "The African Apostolic Church Publicity",
    "excerpt": "My wife was pregnant for two years and two months...",
    "content": "My wife was pregnant for two years and two months but could not give birth. We spent a lot of money looking for help but found none. I then met members of the African Apostolic Church who advised that our problem could be solved there. I sent my wife to the church while I stayed behind. She later told me that church elders had prayed for her and that after three days she would be helped.\n\nIndeed, after three days I was informed that she was well. I asked whether it was a boy or a girl, but I was told there was no baby — she had been carrying goblins for the past two years and two months. When I saw her, she looked like a young girl again. I immediately joined the church after that experience."
